# Token

A bearer credential presented on every request, scoped to one subject and one
audience, and valid only until it expires. ^definition

The block above carries the anchor `^definition`, so other cards can embed the
one sentence rather than the whole page.

For the wire format and lifetime rules see [[/shared/tokens]]; for what
authentication does with them see [[/specs/auth/tokens]].
